```text
and Uses, contained in Section 5.1.4, and Section 5.7.3, Accessory Dwelling Units, for the purpose
of modifying the existing regulation of accessory dwelling units and to provide an expanded as-of-
right path after administrative review.  Mr. Shanor moved to approve on third and final reading,
seconded by Mr. Cook.  Motion carried.  Voting “yes” -- all members of the governing body present
with the exception of Mayor Kaysen voting “no”. (#4110)
ORDINANCE - 3 READING - Amending Section 2.64.030, Definitions, and deleting
rd
Section 2.64.090, Demolition Permit Review, and re-creating Section 2.64.090, Demolition Permit
and Moving Permit Review, of Chapter 2.64, Historic Preservation Board, of Title 2, Administration
and Personnel, of the City Code of the City of Cheyenne, Wyoming.  Mr. Shanor moved to approve
on third and final reading, seconded by Mr. Johnson . Mr. Shanor moved to amend by changing the
definition of Demolition to read as follows: “Demolition” means the removal of a building or
structure, or a portion thereof, or removing or destroying significant architectural elements of the
exterior of a building or structure.  Demolition does not include routine maintenance, simple repairs,
painting, cleaning or the replacement or repair of existing features using similar or like materials,”
seconded by Dr. Rinne.  Upon inquiry, it was advised the amendment was to provide a more specific
definition with parameters for the meaning of “demolition”.  Motion to amend carried.  Voting “yes”
-- all members of the governing body present.  Main motion as amended carried.  Voting “yes” -- all
members of the governing body present. (#4111)
